<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 4.36 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 4.36 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction February 11 versus February 4  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    91/98     183/190	 365/343</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   No bids    No bids	 3.30/3.32</p>
<p> Highest yld     accepted   accepted	3.30/3.33</p>
<p> Lowest  yld					3.30/3.30</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million     0/220	0/650     4,360/970</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  2,935/611    715/800     5,110/1,120</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 47,890 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
